<title>CAMBODIA: SOCCER-CAMBODIA AND INDONESIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CAMBODIA AND INDONESIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PHNOM PENH 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cambodia drew 1-1 (halftime 0-0) with Indonesia in a World Cup soccer Asian zone group 5 qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Cambodia - Hok Sochettra 65</p>
<p>Indonesia - Widodo Putro 80</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000</p>
